### BuildWithAspire MCP Server (MCP Protocol over HTTP)
### This server implements the Model Context Protocol (MCP) specification
### Tools are accessed via JSON-RPC protocol, not REST endpoints
### Base URL: Auto-assigned port (check Aspire dashboard or use http://localhost:5267)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5267

### === Server Status and Health ===

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### === MCP Protocol Endpoints ===
### Note: The MCP server implements JSON-RPC over HTTP
### Individual tool endpoints like /tools/ToolName are NOT available
### Use the API Service's /mcp/call/{toolName} endpoints instead

### MCP Protocol - List Available Tools
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "1",
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}

### MCP Protocol - Call Weather Tool (Current Weather)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "2",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "GetCurrentWeather",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}

### MCP Protocol - Call Weather Tool (Forecast)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "3",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "GetWeatherForecast",
    "arguments": {
      "maxDays": 5
    }
  }
}

### MCP Protocol - Call Temperature Conversion Tool
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "4",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "ConvertTemperature",
    "arguments": {
      "temperature": 25,
      "fromUnit": "C"
    }
  }
}

### MCP Protocol - Call System Info Tool
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "5",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "GetSystemInfo",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}

### === Testing via API Service ===
### For easier testing, use the API Service MCP endpoints:

### Get Available Tools (via API Service)
GET http://localhost:5020/mcp/tools

### Call Weather Forecast (via API Service)
POST http://localhost:5020/mcp/call/GetWeatherForecast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "MaxDays": 5
}

### Call Current Weather (via API Service)
POST http://localhost:5020/mcp/call/GetCurrentWeather
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Call Random Number Tool (via API Service)
POST http://localhost:5020/mcp/call/GenerateRandomNumber
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Min": 1,
  "Max": 100
}